LAST_SUCCESS=Task 47 step 3c device-verified 2026-05-27. Multi-surface visibility working end-to-end: wart-app fills the top of the screen, IME (war.ime.keyboard) sits at the bottom as a 1100-px overlay panel; both surfaces composited by SF as opaque non-overlapping rects. Smoke confirmed: manual `wart-arbiter overlay war.ime.keyboard` / `overlay-clear`, AND auto-tie via `attach-editor`/`detach-editor`. Disp Frame=0 1780 1440 2880 confirmed via dumpsys SurfaceFlinger. Architectural fix: AOSP BlastInputSurface pattern (from EndToEndNativeInputTest.cpp) — overlay uses a PARENT container SurfaceControl (eFXSurfaceContainer) with a CHILD buffer-state surface (eFXSurfaceBufferState) parented to it. Position/layer/crop on the parent; BBQ + input window on the child. Setting position directly on a BBQ-backed buffer-state surface was empirically a no-op on taimen Adreno. setLayer / setVisible / setSize / setPosition all route to g_overlay_parent for overlay surfaces. The two-surface hierarchy is visible in dumpsys: `wart-ime-overlay-parent ─ wart-ime-overlay`.
NOTES=Eleven artifacts shipped: wit/skiko-gfx.wit + 3 mirrors (request-overlay-height); skiko Keyboard.Import.requestOverlayHeight binding; sf_surface.{cpp,h} (sf_create_overlay_surface + sf_resize_overlay + parent-container pattern); sf_surface.rs (create_overlay + resize_overlay + ANativeWindow_setBuffersGeometry); app_role.rs (OverlayBehind + SIGRTMIN+1); standalone.rs (--standalone-overlay branch + OverlayBehind arm + per-frame overlay-resize drain); keyboard_host_impl.rs (request_overlay_height bridge); zygote.rs (LAUNCH_GUI_OVERLAY); wart-arbiter state.rs + main.rs (OverlayState + cmd_overlay/overlay-clear/launch-overlay + auto-tie); zygote_client.rs (launch_gui_overlay); war.ime.keyboard RealComposeApp.kt (LaunchedEffect requestOverlayHeight(1100u)). Built libsf_surface.so on a-03; wart-host + wart-arbiter compile clean; IME warpkg installed + verified. Outstanding for step 4: real focus arbitration between two surfaces, tap-outside-to-dismiss. Plan file at /home/harry/.claude/plans/splendid-stirring-lerdorf.md.
